    "details": {
      "description": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A lean ranger with cropped grey hair and a weathered face, wearing a Pitaxian green cloak and a quiver at the hip. This is a sketch from the front of Wren's journal.</p>\n<section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-KQaIrHtzUhA1Us0G\">\n<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.u3owPBswTYDEuJAk]{13. The Quilled Hunter}.</strong> Irovetti's ranger. Only a torn green cloak remains in the den; Wren's bow and pack lie nearby.</p>\n</section>",
